     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\nHi Yaxun,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Thanks for your interest in CODEX. CODEX by default uses hg19 as reference. You can however adapt it to hg38 instead. To do so you need to download the package <a href=\"https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/data/annotation/html/BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/data/annotation/html/BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243890125000&amp;usg=AOvVaw09oGhulggQ_JiYOEhp_jiK\">https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/data/annotation/html/BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.html</a> .\r\n After loading CODEX, you need to load this package so that the Hsapiens by CODEX (hg19) is masked as hg38.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The reference is only used to calculate the GC content. Mappability is bit more complicated and takes longer to run. For CODEX, we pre-compute the mappability for all exonic regions in hg19. For your case, I recommend setting all mappability to\r\n 1. That is, mapp=rep(1,length(gc)). Mappability is only used in the QC procedure so this shouldn’t affect your final output too much. If you want, you can also perform QC based on annotation results, i.e., you can remove all exons within segmental duplication\r\n regions, which generally have low mappability.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I hope that this helps and feel free to let me know if you have more questions.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Yuchao</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>On May 2, 2017, at 2:41 AM, 魏亚勋 &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yaxu...@ablife.cc</a>&gt; wrote:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span></span>Dear Dr Yuchao Jiang:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&#39;} &#39;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"> \r\n   </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\">    Thank you for your attention.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&#39;} &#39;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"> \r\n   </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\">    I have applied the package CODEX to my study about Detecting Copy number variant. It is helpful and powerful .But now there is a question about\r\n CODEX for the useage. I want to use </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\">gencodev22 as the reference, and your CODEX use </span><span style=\"background-color:window;font-family:NimbusRomNo9L-Regu;font-size:10pt\">BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg19</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n ad the default reference.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&#39;} &#39;\">     </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"> \r\n   So , there is a solution for this condition ? </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&#39;} &#39;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"> \r\n   Thanks for your efforts again!</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&#39;} &#39;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"> \r\n   Your.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&#39;} &#39;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;&#39;;font-size:10.5pt;line-height:1.5;background-color:window\"> \r\n   Yaxun Wei.</span></div>\r\n<hr size=\"1\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;width:210px;min-height:1px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;Microsoft YaHei UI&#39;;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:21px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">\r\n<span>\r\n<div style=\"margin:10px;font-family:verdana;font-size:10pt\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:华文细黑;font-size:15px;line-height:22px\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr align=\"left\" size=\"1\" style=\"font-family:华文细黑;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;width:210px;min-height:1px\">\r\n</div>\r\n</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
