     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Im not sure how many NaNs you get in the gc content you calculate. If it is a significant proportion, something can be wrong. Are the coordinates in your bed\r\n file in concordance with the hg38 human reference?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">If the input is correct, you can proceed as below:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">After gc = getgc(…), you can use the code below to set all NaN and NA to 0 , which will be futher removed in the QC step.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">gc[<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243890134000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1cTl-6uL_m5YKHqOGViG2M\">is.na</a>(gc)]=0<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">gc[is.nan(gc)]=0\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n</span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">魏亚勋</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yaxu...@ablife.cc</a>]\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, May 04, 2017 5:13 AM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Jiang, Yuchao &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yuc...@wharton.upenn.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> </span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">回复</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">: Re: questions for CODEX package<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Hi Yuchao,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">    <span style=\"background:white\">    Thanks for your reply. Now, I use &quot;getgc&quot; to achieve the gc content about one chromosome. There are some &quot;NaN&quot;\r\n value in the result . Then ,in &quot;qc&quot;, some errors happen like &quot;Error in NSBS(i, x, exact = exact, upperBoundIsStrict = !allow.append) : subscript contains NAs&quot;.</span><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">    I don&#39;t know how to exclude the NaN value , do you have some solutions?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">    <span style=\"background:white\">    Thanks again!</span><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">\r\n<hr size=\"1\" width=\"210\" style=\"width:157.5pt\" noshade style=\"color:#b5c4df\" align=\"left\">\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left:7.5pt;margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:7.5pt;margin-bottom:7.5pt\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;STXihei&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin-left:6.0pt\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#efefef\"><b><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">发件人：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Jiang,\r\n Yuchao</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#efefef\"><b><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">发送时间：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> 2017-05-04 07:56<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#efefef\"><b><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">收件人：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif\">魏亚勋</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#efefef\"><b><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">抄送：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">CODEX:\r\n COpy number Detection by EXome sequencing</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:#efefef\"><b><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">主题：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> Re: questions for\r\n CODEX package<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
