     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><blockquote style=\"margin-left:6.0pt\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Hi Yaxun,\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Thanks for your interest in CODEX. CODEX by default uses hg19 as reference. You can however adapt it to hg38 instead. To do so you need to download the\r\n package <a href=\"https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/data/annotation/html/BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/data/annotation/html/BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793243890134000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Iki8KuPDVIN-2eMR-LjD7\">https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/data/annotation/html/BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg38.html</a> . After loading CODEX, you need to\r\n load this package so that the Hsapiens by CODEX (hg19) is masked as hg38.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">The reference is only used to calculate the GC content. Mappability is bit more complicated and takes longer to run. For CODEX, we pre-compute the mappability\r\n for all exonic regions in hg19. For your case, I recommend setting all mappability to 1. That is, mapp=rep(1,length(gc)). Mappability is only used in the QC procedure so this shouldn<span lang=\"ZH-CN\">’</span>t affect your final output too much. If you want,\r\n you can also perform QC based on annotation results, i.e., you can remove all exons within segmental duplication regions, which generally have low mappability.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">I hope that this helps and feel free to let me know if you have more questions.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Yuchao<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin-left:6.0pt\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">On May 2, 2017, at 2:41 AM,\r\n<span lang=\"ZH-CN\">魏亚勋</span> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">yaxu...@ablife.cc</a>&gt; wrote:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Dear Dr Yuchao Jiang:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;}&quot;,serif;color:black\">    </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:white\">        Thank you for your attention.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;}&quot;,serif;color:black\">    </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:white\">        I have applied the package\r\n CODEX to my study about Detecting Copy number variant. It is helpful and powerful .But now there is a question about CODEX for the useage. I want to use gencodev22 as the reference, and your CODEX use </span><span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;NimbusRomNo9L-Regu&quot;,serif;color:black;background:white\">BSgenome.Hsapiens.UCSC.hg19</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> ad the default reference.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;}&quot;,serif;color:black\">     </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:white\">    So , there is a solution\r\n for this condition ? </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;}&quot;,serif;color:black\">    </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:white\">    Thanks for your efforts\r\n again!</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;}&quot;,serif;color:black\">    </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:white\">    Your.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;}&quot;,serif;color:black\">    </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:white\">    Yaxun Wei.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">\r\n<hr size=\"1\" width=\"210\" style=\"width:157.5pt\" align=\"left\">\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left:7.5pt;margin-top:7.5pt;margin-right:7.5pt;margin-bottom:7.5pt\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:16.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:&quot;STXihei&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:15.75pt\"><span style=\"font-size